(async()=>{const n=v=>v==null?'Pending':Number(v).toLocaleString(),mb=v=>`${(v/1048576).toFixed(1)} MiB`;try{const r=await fetch('experiments.json',{cache:'no-store'});if(!r.ok)throw Error('Results unavailable');const d=await r.json();document.getElementById('experiment-updated').textContent=`Last published update: ${new Date(d.updated_at).toLocaleString()}`;const b=d.baseline;document.getElementById('experiment-results').innerHTML=`<tr><td>Original 4× baseline</td><td>500</td><td>${n(b.registered_images)} / 500</td><td>${n(b.sparse_points)}</td><td>${n(b.dense_points)}</td><td>${b.reprojection_error.toFixed(3)} px</td></tr>`+d.experiments.map(x=>`<tr><td>${x.label}</td><td>${n(x.input_images)}</td><td>${n(x.metrics.registered_images)} / ${x.input_images}</td><td>${n(x.metrics.points3D)}</td><td>${n(x.dense_points)}</td><td>${x.metrics.mean_reprojection_error==null?'Pending':x.metrics.mean_reprojection_error.toFixed(3)+' px'}</td></tr>`).join('');document.getElementById('experiment-progress').innerHTML=d.experiments.map(x=>`<details open><summary>${x.label}</summary><p>Extraction: ${x.extraction_complete?'validated native + 4× PNGs':'in progress'}. ${x.registered_union} unique frames in non-empty components.</p><p>${['features','matching','mapping','bundle_adjustment','undistortion','depth_maps','fusion'].map(k=>`${k.replaceAll('_',' ')}: <strong>${x.stages[k]?.state||'queued'}</strong>`).join(' · ')}</p><p>${x.components.length?x.components.map(c=>`Component ${c.id}: ${c.registered_images} views / ${n(c.points)} points`).join(' · '):'Components will appear after sparse mapping completes.'}</p><p>Local output: <code>${x.folders.colmap}/</code></p></details>`).join('');document.getElementById('experiment-folders').innerHTML=d.experiments.flatMap(x=>[['native','full_resolution','2160 × 3840'],['4x','downsample_4x_540x960','540 × 960']].map(([key,folder,size])=>`<tr><td>${x.label}</td><td><code>${x.folders[key]}/</code></td><td>${size}</td><td>${x.input_images}</td><td>${mb(x.storage_bytes[folder])}</td></tr>`)).join('')}catch(e){document.getElementById('experiment-updated').textContent=e.message}})();
